<title>AUSTRALIA: Golf-Players' Championship final round scores.</title>
<headline>Golf-Players' Championship final round scores.</headline>
<dateline>GOLD COAST 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading final round scores and totals in the Players' Championship golf tournament at the par-71 Robina Woods course on Sunday (Australian unless stated):</p>
<p>270 Bradley Hughes 70 65 66 69</p>
<p>282 Peter Lonard 72 73 67 70, Robert Stephens 74 66 69 73</p>
<p>284 Peter Teravainen (U.S.) 70 74 68 72, J.J. West (U.S.) 65 70</p>
<p>77 72, Scott Laycock 67 71 72 74</p>
<p>285 Justin Cooper 67 64 79 75</p>
<p>286 Darren Cole 72 70 74 70</p>
<p>287 Greg Chalmers 71 71 74 71, Tony Christie (New Zealand) 69</p>
<p>75 71 72, Gavin Coles 71 72 72 72, Stephen Leaney 69 72 72 74, Craig Spence 65 74 74 74</p>
<p>288 David McKenzie 72 72 73 71, Paul Gow 74 69 71 74</p>
<p>289 Dominique Boulet (Hong Kong) 69 74 79 67, Craig Kamps</p>
<p>(South Africa) 73 68 77 71, Paul Devenport (New Zealand) 72 70</p>
<p>74 73, Wayne Grady 73 70 72 74, Darren Barnes 72 70 73 74, Anthony Painter 70 69 75 75</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
